  "historyNote": "#6585, INTERIM, eff 10-1-97, EXPIRED: 1-29-98; ss and moved by #6660, eff 12-23-97 (from Emp 307.03), EXPIRED: 12-23-05; ss by #8522, INTERIM, eff 12-23-05, EXPIRED: 6-21-06 New. #8676, eff 7-8-06, EXPIRED: 7-8-15; renumbered by #10081 (formerly Emp 307.02) New. #11034, eff 2-10-16",
